desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Debug Template Tag"
	title_zh: "检测到Debug Template Tag",
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-debug-template-tag"
	risk: "information-exposure"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
Detected a debug template tag in a Django template. This dumps debugging information to the page when debug mode is enabled. Showing debug information to users is dangerous because it may reveal information about your environment that malicious actors can use to gain access to the system. Remove the debug tag.

### 风险类型
敏感信息泄露（information-exposure）

### 影响
应用可能暴露内部路径、环境信息或敏感数据，攻击者可借此收集攻击面。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-489: Active Debug Code
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
限制敏感信息的输出范围，关闭不必要的调试接口，并对暴露内容进行脱敏。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.html": <<<POS
{% debug %}

POS
	"safefile://neg.sample": <<<NEG
# safe sample
no secrets here
just regular code
NEG
)

${*.html}.pattern_regex(/({% debug %})/) as $p0
$p0 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	risk: "information-exposure",
	level: "middle",
	title: "Debug Template Tag",
	title_zh: "检测到Debug Template Tag",
	message: "Debug Template Tag",
}
